sequenceDiagram
    participant Swift as SwiftUI Task
    participant Bridge as Bridge / AsyncSequence
    participant Kotlin as Kotlin suspend / Flow
    participant Repo as Repository
    Swift->>Bridge: 开始 for await / 订阅
    Bridge->>Kotlin: collect 或调用 suspend
    Kotlin->>Repo: fetch / observe
    Repo-->>Kotlin: 返回 value
    Kotlin-->>Bridge: emit state
    Bridge-->>Swift: 更新 Swift 状态
    Swift->>Bridge: Task 取消
    Bridge->>Kotlin: 取消 collector / Job
